     {
      "label": "oil",
      "head": "Red oil can: *pressure*",
      "pose": "present",
      "face": "worried",
      "prop": {
       "type": "dash",
       "hi": [
        "oil"
       ]
      }
     },
     "The red oil can means low oil pressure. Stop the engine as soon as it is safe. Driving on can wreck it."
    ],
    [
     "c17_4",
     {
      "label": "temp",
      "head": "Thermometer: *overheating*",
      "pose": "facepalm",
